    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages growth and biomass for a resource cell. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class extends <ref refid="class_edible_growth" kindref="compound">EdibleGrowth</ref> and provides methods to update, consume, and manage the biomass of a resource cell. It maintains a link to the owning <ref refid="class_cell_resource_interface" kindref="compound">CellResourceInterface</ref> and the corresponding <ref refid="class_resource_species_growth" kindref="compound">ResourceSpeciesGrowth</ref> object. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
